  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At the graves beside Tie Ruo Nan, he offers condolences while she stares at the tombstones. Former clan leader Tie Mu Bai approaches from behind, touches his shoulder, and suppresses the force in his aperture until he cannot move. Once he recognizes the speaker he blurts out “old clan leader,” bows deeply, and refuses Tie Mu Bai’s request to be called by name, treating him with open reverence while Tie Mu Bai walks on toward Tie Ruo Nan.",
      "chapters": [
        369
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tie_ruo_nan",
        "char_tie_mu_bai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On San Cha Mountain, as head of Tie clan’s four old-timers, he softens his voice to tell Tie Ruo Nan that the fanatic charge likely ties to Mo Wu Tian, while the four surround her in a protective formation. Another of the four then argues they should not pick a fight with that rank five expert and should keep their objective on little beast king.",
      "chapters": [
        394
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "san-cha-mountain-afterward",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_san_cha_mountain",
        "fac_tie_clan",
        "char_mo_wu_tian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During Fang Yuan’s escape attempt, four chains extend from nowhere, bind his limbs, and drag him into the void; he reappears in the bronze hall, where the four old-timers stand at north, south, east, and west around him and activate their killer move Infinite Search and Lock.",
      "chapters": [
        398
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "capture-of-fang-yuan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "move_infinite_search_and_lock"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With Tie Bai Qi covering the dog groups, Tie Ruo Nan brings the four old-timers into the hall; they join the fight behind her against Bai Ning Bing, and later join her again when that scheme is exposed.",
      "chapters": [
        403
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bronze-hall-assault",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tie_bai_qi",
        "char_bai_ning_bing"
      ]
    }
  ],
